---
/* A static, decorative mock of the course player (no JS) to show the experience. */
---
<section class="sec wrap" aria-labelledby="pp-h">
  <p class="sec__kicker">Inside a course</p>
  <h2 id="pp-h" class="sec__title">A player that feels like a game, not a lecture.</h2>
  <div class="pp reveal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="pp__bar">
      <span class="pp__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
      <span class="pp__crumb">Copilot for Product Teams / Brief to prototype</span>
      <span class="chip chip--xp">⚡ 450 XP</span><span class="chip">🔥 3</span><span class="chip">🏅 2</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pp__body">
      <div class="pp__side">
        <p class="pp__ring">50%</p>
        <p class="pp__mod is-done">✓ Your AI workbench</p>
        <p class="pp__mod is-done">✓ Project home: GitHub</p>
        <p class="pp__mod is-cur">3 Brief to prototype</p>
        <p class="pp__mod">4 Skills for makers</p>
        <p class="pp__mod">5 Go live on Netlify</p>
        <p class="pp__mod">6 Hand off like a pro</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pp__lesson">
        <p class="pp__k">Module 3 of 6 · 10 min</p>
        <p class="pp__h">Brief to prototype</p>
        <p class="pp__line"></p><p class="pp__line pp__line--s"></p>
        <div class="pp__quiz"><p>Which prompt gets a better first draft?</p><span class="is-ok">✓ The one with audience + goal</span><span>The short one</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pp__code">
        <pre><code><span class="k">&lt;button</span> <span class="a">class</span>=<span class="s">"cta"</span><span class="k">&gt;</span>
  Start trial
<span class="k">&lt;/button&gt;</span>

<span class="c">/* focus ring ✓ */</span>
<span class="a">.cta:focus-visible</span> {"{"}
  outline: <span class="s">3px solid</span>;
{"}"}</code></pre>
        <span class="pp__run">▶ Run checks · 3/3 ✓</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pp__toast">+150 XP · Module complete!</div>
  </div>
</section>
